# Commits

Use a single-line [Conventional Commit](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/). No body, no footers, no trailers.

```
type: subject
```

- `type` is `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `test`, `refactor`, or `chore`
- `subject` is lowercase imperative, with no trailing period
- Do not add `Co-authored-by` or any other co-author mention

Use:

```
docs: add mvp design spec
```

Do not use:

```
Add the Honya MVP design.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
```
